cene, the second witness's later departure must still fan a\nfresh hearsay copy out, attributed to *that* witness as\n``told_by``. Locking this catches a regression where the\npropagation tag was stored on the node and the second departure\nbecame a silent no-op.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"3ea2cd1c0f7d56f7d211244ff01957b6","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"e2cc1616e98e9519d75579041b86c247","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"20ed3318d90d81a2a41be16472184c4d","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_memory_preservation"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_memory_preservation.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[],"order":1589,"categories":[]}